317	     * the fiscal year of the {@link #getRegistrationDate() business-day-adjusted registration date}.
318	     * The fiscal year starts on 1 July and is named by the calendar year in which it ends, so a
319	     * registration date on or after 1 July belongs to the following calendar year's fiscal year
320	     * (e.g. {@code 2026-07-01} is {@code 'FY27'}) while an earlier date stays in the current one
321	     * (e.g. {@code 2026-06-15} is {@code 'FY26'}). Returns {@code null} when the registration date is
322	     * absent.
